<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -KLA Instrument upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -KLA Instrument upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Gunnar Miller upgraded KLA Instruments Corp to buy from attractive, according to his offioce.</p>
<p>-- raised earnings estimate to $1.75 per share from $1.70 for 1997, ending in June, and to $2.30 from $2.20 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- raised 12-month price target to $50 from $45. Shares fell 5/8 to 39-7/8.</p>
</text>
